{
  "id":"design-online-judge","version":1,"title":"Design an Online Coding Judge","difficulty":"Advanced",
  "scenario":"Users submit code and expect a quick acknowledgment while compilation and judging happen asynchronously. Route submissions from the API to a message queue, then to worker instances, then to a database that stores verdicts. The queue keeps jobs when workers are full; API acknowledgment latency and completed verdicts are measured separately. Meet both goals within the resource budget.",
  "starter":{"schemaVersion":3,"nodes":[{"id":"source","kind":"source","label":"Users","position":{"x":50,"y":200},"config":{"queueLimit":0}},{"id":"api","kind":"api","label":"Submission API","position":{"x":310,"y":200},"config":{"processingSlots":1,"maxInFlight":101,"meanServiceTimeUs":2000,"queueLimit":100}}],"edges":[]},
  "workload":{"schemaVersion":1,"seed":"74","entryNodeId":"source","durationUs":10000000,"drainTimeoutUs":5000000,"arrivalRateRps":300,"readFraction":0,"scenario":"async_jobs"},
  "goals":[{"id":"success","label":"Acknowledge at least 99% of submissions","metric":"success_fraction","operator":"gte","target":99},{"id":"p95","label":"P95 acknowledgment at or below 15 ms","metric":"p95_latency_us","operator":"lte","target":15},{"id":"p99","label":"P99 acknowledgment at or below 25 ms","metric":"p99_latency_us","operator":"lte","target":25},{"id":"jobs","label":"Complete at least 99% of enqueued jobs","metric":"job_completion_fraction","operator":"gte","target":99},{"id":"correct","label":"Store correct verdicts for at least 99% of submissions","metric":"functional_correct_fraction","operator":"gte","target":99}],
  "hints":["A message queue acknowledges a submission after accepting its job; the worker and database run afterward.","Connect the queue to multiple worker boxes to share jobs. The queue backlog grows if workers cannot keep up.","A worker processes the submission; the database persists its verdict. Both are required for a correct completed job."],
  "allowedKinds":["source","api","load_balancer","message_queue","worker","database","object_storage"],
  "resourceBudget":{"maxNodes":7,"maxSlots":14,"maxProcessingSlotsPerNode":4,"maxByKind":{"source":1,"api":2,"load_balancer":1,"message_queue":1,"worker":3,"database":1,"object_storage":1}},
  "componentSpecs":{"api":{"meanServiceTimeUs":2000,"queueLimit":100},"load_balancer":{"meanServiceTimeUs":100,"queueLimit":100},"message_queue":{"meanServiceTimeUs":1000,"queueLimit":1000},"worker":{"meanServiceTimeUs":20000,"queueLimit":0},"database":{"meanServiceTimeUs":4000,"queueLimit":100},"object_storage":{"meanServiceTimeUs":6000,"queueLimit":100}},
  "solution":{"explanation":"The API publishes each submission to a queue and returns immediately when the queue accepts it. Two explicit worker instances pull jobs independently and write verdicts to one database. Worker slots are provisioned to drain the published workload.","architecture":{"schemaVersion":3,"nodes":[{"id":"source","kind":"source","label":"Users","position":{"x":40,"y":210},"config":{"queueLimit":0}},{"id":"api","kind":"api","label":"Submission API","position":{"x":260,"y":210},"config":{"processingSlots":2,"maxInFlight":102,"meanServiceTimeUs":2000,"queueLimit":100}},{"id":"mq","kind":"message_queue","label":"Judging queue","position":{"x":500,"y":210},"config":{"processingSlots":1,"maxInFlight":1001,"meanServiceTimeUs":1000,"queueLimit":1000}},{"id":"worker-a","kind":"worker","label":"Judge worker A","position":{"x":750,"y":80},"config":{"processingSlots":4,"maxInFlight":4,"meanServiceTimeUs":20000,"queueLimit":0}},{"id":"worker-b","kind":"worker","label":"Judge worker B","position":{"x":750,"y":340},"config":{"processingSlots":4,"maxInFlight":4,"meanServiceTimeUs":20000,"queueLimit":0}},{"id":"db","kind":"database","label":"Verdicts DB","position":{"x":1000,"y":210},"config":{"processingSlots":3,"maxInFlight":103,"meanServiceTimeUs":4000,"queueLimit":100}}],"edges":[{"id":"s-a","source":"source","target":"api","route":"always","delayUs":0},{"id":"a-q","source":"api","target":"mq","route":"always","delayUs":0},{"id":"q-wa","source":"mq","target":"worker-a","route":"always","delayUs":0},{"id":"q-wb","source":"mq","target":"worker-b","route":"always","delayUs":0},{"id":"wa-d","source":"worker-a","target":"db","route":"always","delayUs":0},{"id":"wb-d","source":"worker-b","target":"db","route":"always","delayUs":0}]}}
}
